* ''The Lararium stands before the harness moves in, and before any measurement'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"We stand the LArarium and dogfodo the harness INTO the LArarium before all that (delete that last direction from the plan/roadmaps, it's just more churn)"//). The order runs: the dogfood Lararium stands, `M5`'s memory stage builds on it, the harness moves into it (its controls as signed tiddlers in the daemon wiki, <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/seat-harness#/the-swarm-controls`>>), and only then does measurement work open (the outcome ledger, the cached-token measure, the capability manifest's drift test).

